IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sgba-nouns`
IMPORT `sgba-vintage`
IMPORT `sgba-sched`
IMPORT `sgba-p1-defs`

-- Broadcasting Act 1994 (Singapore), 2020 Revised Edition, informal consolidation in force from 25 September 2024.
-- LAYER 1, PART 5 (BROADCASTING APPARATUS, ss 20 and 21).
-- Section 20 is dated: "broadcasting apparatus" depends on the First Schedule, so the rules take the date and answer
-- NOTHING outside the window in which the deposited text of the Act is the text in force.
-- The licence a person holds, the Authority's exemption, and the terms of a licence are facts asked as plain inputs.

§ `20. Licensing of broadcasting apparatus`

-- src:1425 | 20.—(1) Subject to this section, a person must not —
-- src:1427 | (a) install any broadcasting apparatus in any place, or on board
-- src:1428 | any ship, aircraft or vehicle registered in Singapore;
-- src:1430 | (b) import, offer for sale, sell or have in the person’s
-- src:1431 | possession with a view to sale, any broadcasting
-- src:1432 | apparatus; or
-- src:1434 | (c) operate or have on any premises in Singapore owned or
-- src:1435 | occupied by the person broadcasting apparatus on or by
-- src:1436 | which broadcasting services are received,
@ref s 20(1)(a) to (c) (src:1425-1436)
-- Whether the conduct falls within paragraph (a), (b) or (c), on the facts the person can state.
-- READING of (c) (fork F-BA-03), reading A, the default: "operate or have on any premises in Singapore owned or occupied by the person
-- broadcasting apparatus on or by which broadcasting services are received" is read with the premises phrase qualifying
-- BOTH "operate" and "have", and "on or by which broadcasting services are received" qualifying the apparatus. Reading B (the phrase qualifies only "have") is below.
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      a IS A Apparatus
      w IS A `Dealing with apparatus`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 20(1) the dealing is within paragraph (a), (b) or (c) of the subsection, on` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 2(1) the apparatus is broadcasting apparatus on` d a
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST isBroadcastingApparatus THEN
        JUST (isBroadcastingApparatus AND (w's `installs it in a place, or on board a ship, aircraft or vehicle registered in Singapore` OR w's `imports it, offers it for sale, sells it, or has it in possession with a view to sale` OR ((w's `operates it` OR w's `has it`) AND w's `the place is premises in Singapore owned or occupied by the person` AND w's `broadcasting services are received on or by it`)))

-- src:1425 | 20.—(1) Subject to this section, a person must not —
-- src:1427 | (a) install any broadcasting apparatus in any place, or on board
-- src:1428 | any ship, aircraft or vehicle registered in Singapore;
@ref s 20(1)(a) (src:1425-1428)
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      a IS A Apparatus
      w IS A `Dealing with apparatus`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 20(1)(a) the person installs broadcasting apparatus, on` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 2(1) the apparatus is broadcasting apparatus on` d a
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST isBroadcastingApparatus THEN JUST (isBroadcastingApparatus AND w's `installs it in a place, or on board a ship, aircraft or vehicle registered in Singapore`)

-- src:1430 | (b) import, offer for sale, sell or have in the person’s
-- src:1431 | possession with a view to sale, any broadcasting
-- src:1432 | apparatus; or
@ref s 20(1)(b) (src:1430-1432)
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      a IS A Apparatus
      w IS A `Dealing with apparatus`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 20(1)(b) the person imports, offers for sale, sells or has in possession with a view to sale broadcasting apparatus, on` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 2(1) the apparatus is broadcasting apparatus on` d a
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST isBroadcastingApparatus THEN JUST (isBroadcastingApparatus AND w's `imports it, offers it for sale, sells it, or has it in possession with a view to sale`)

-- src:1434 | (c) operate or have on any premises in Singapore owned or
-- src:1435 | occupied by the person broadcasting apparatus on or by
-- src:1436 | which broadcasting services are received,
@ref s 20(1)(c) (src:1434-1436)
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      a IS A Apparatus
      w IS A `Dealing with apparatus`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 20(1)(c) the person operates, or has on premises owned or occupied by the person, broadcasting apparatus on or by which broadcasting services are received, on` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 2(1) the apparatus is broadcasting apparatus on` d a
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST isBroadcastingApparatus THEN JUST (isBroadcastingApparatus AND (w's `operates it` OR w's `has it`) AND w's `the place is premises in Singapore owned or occupied by the person` AND w's `broadcasting services are received on or by it`)

-- src:1438 | except under and in accordance with a licence granted under this
-- src:1439 | section.
@ref s 20(1) "except under and in accordance with a licence granted under this section" (src:1438-1439)
-- "in accordance with" is read as: the person holds the licence, the dealing falls within the licence's period, and within its terms and conditions (s 20(2)).
GIVEN `the person holds a broadcasting apparatus licence granted under section 20` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the dealing is within the period of the licence` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the dealing is within the terms and conditions of the licence` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 20(1) the dealing is under and in accordance with a licence granted under the section` MEANS
    `the person holds a broadcasting apparatus licence granted under section 20` AND `the dealing is within the period of the licence` AND `the dealing is within the terms and conditions of the licence`

-- src:1441 | (2) Every licence granted under subsection (1) must be in such form
-- src:1442 | and for such period and may contain such terms and conditions as the
-- src:1443 | Authority may determine.
@ref s 20(2) (src:1441-1443)
-- The form, period and terms of a licence are the Authority's to determine; a licence in some form, for some period, on some terms is a licence.
GIVEN `the Authority has determined the form, the period and the terms and conditions of the licence` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 20(2) the licence is in the form, for the period and on the terms the Authority determined` MEANS
    `the Authority has determined the form, the period and the terms and conditions of the licence`

-- src:1445 | (3) Subsection (1) is not to be construed as requiring any person
-- src:1446 | who works a broadcasting apparatus in the course of the person’s duty
-- src:1447 | as a member of the Singapore Armed Forces, the Singapore Police
-- src:1448 | Force, the Vigilante Corps or the Singapore Civil Defence Force to
-- src:1449 | obtain a licence under this Act.
@ref s 20(3) (src:1445-1449)
GIVEN `the person works a broadcasting apparatus in the course of the person's duty as a member of the Singapore Armed Forces, the Singapore Police Force, the Vigilante Corps or the Singapore Civil Defence Force` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 20(3) the person is not required by subsection (1) to obtain a licence under this Act` MEANS
    IF `the person works a broadcasting apparatus in the course of the person's duty as a member of the Singapore Armed Forces, the Singapore Police Force, the Vigilante Corps or the Singapore Civil Defence Force`
    THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING

-- src:1451 | (4) The Authority may exempt any person or broadcasting
-- src:1452 | apparatus or class of broadcasting apparatus from subsection (1).
@ref s 20(4) (src:1451-1452)
-- The Authority's power to exempt a person, an apparatus or a class of apparatus from subsection (1): a fact asked of the person.
GIVEN `the Authority has exempted the person, the apparatus or the class of apparatus from subsection (1)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 20(4) the person, the apparatus or the class of apparatus is exempt from subsection (1)` MEANS
    `the Authority has exempted the person, the apparatus or the class of apparatus from subsection (1)`

-- src:1425 | 20.—(1) Subject to this section, a person must not —
-- src:1427 | (a) install any broadcasting apparatus in any place, or on board
-- src:1428 | any ship, aircraft or vehicle registered in Singapore;
-- src:1430 | (b) import, offer for sale, sell or have in the person’s
-- src:1431 | possession with a view to sale, any broadcasting
-- src:1432 | apparatus; or
-- src:1434 | (c) operate or have on any premises in Singapore owned or
-- src:1435 | occupied by the person broadcasting apparatus on or by
-- src:1436 | which broadcasting services are received,
-- src:1438 | except under and in accordance with a licence granted under this
-- src:1439 | section.
-- src:1441 | (2) Every licence granted under subsection (1) must be in such form
-- src:1442 | and for such period and may contain such terms and conditions as the
-- src:1443 | Authority may determine.
-- src:1445 | (3) Subsection (1) is not to be construed as requiring any person
-- src:1446 | who works a broadcasting apparatus in the course of the person’s duty
-- src:1447 | as a member of the Singapore Armed Forces, the Singapore Police
-- src:1448 | Force, the Vigilante Corps or the Singapore Civil Defence Force to
-- src:1449 | obtain a licence under this Act.
-- src:1451 | (4) The Authority may exempt any person or broadcasting
-- src:1452 | apparatus or class of broadcasting apparatus from subsection (1).
@ref s 20 as a whole: the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c) (src:1425-1452)
-- NOTHING outside the window of the deposited text. A person is outside the subsection if licensed (and within the licence), or exempt under (3) or (4),
-- or, by section 60, exempted by a Ministerial order (asked as a fact).
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      a IS A Apparatus
      w IS A `Dealing with apparatus`
      `the dealing is under and in accordance with a licence granted under section 20` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is not required to obtain a licence by section 20(3)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person, the apparatus or the class of apparatus is exempt under section 20(4)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is exempted by an order under section 60(b)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), on` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 20(1) the dealing is within paragraph (a), (b) or (c) of the subsection, on` d a w
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST within THEN
        JUST (within AND (NOT `the dealing is under and in accordance with a licence granted under section 20`) AND (NOT `the person is not required to obtain a licence by section 20(3)`) AND (NOT `the person, the apparatus or the class of apparatus is exempt under section 20(4)`) AND (NOT `the person is exempted by an order under section 60(b)`))

-- READING B of (c) (fork F-BA-03): the premises phrase qualifies only "have", so "operate ... broadcasting apparatus on or by which broadcasting services are received" is not confined to the person's own premises.
-- Reading A stays the default above. These functions restate (c) and the whole of s 20(1) on reading B; they restate no other rule.
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      a IS A Apparatus
      w IS A `Dealing with apparatus`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 20(1)(c) the person operates broadcasting apparatus, or has it on premises owned or occupied by the person, and broadcasting services are received, on, reading B of F-BA-03` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 2(1) the apparatus is broadcasting apparatus on` d a
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST isBroadcastingApparatus THEN JUST (isBroadcastingApparatus AND (w's `operates it` OR (w's `has it` AND w's `the place is premises in Singapore owned or occupied by the person`)) AND w's `broadcasting services are received on or by it`)

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      a IS A Apparatus
      w IS A `Dealing with apparatus`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 20(1) the dealing is within paragraph (a), (b) or (c) of the subsection, on, reading B of F-BA-03` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 2(1) the apparatus is broadcasting apparatus on` d a
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST isBroadcastingApparatus THEN
        JUST (isBroadcastingApparatus AND (w's `installs it in a place, or on board a ship, aircraft or vehicle registered in Singapore` OR w's `imports it, offers it for sale, sells it, or has it in possession with a view to sale` OR ((w's `operates it` OR (w's `has it` AND w's `the place is premises in Singapore owned or occupied by the person`)) AND w's `broadcasting services are received on or by it`)))

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      a IS A Apparatus
      w IS A `Dealing with apparatus`
      `the dealing is under and in accordance with a licence granted under section 20` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is not required to obtain a licence by section 20(3)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person, the apparatus or the class of apparatus is exempt under section 20(4)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is exempted by an order under section 60(b)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 20(1) the person contravenes section 20(1)(a), (b) or (c), on, reading B of F-BA-03` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 20(1) the dealing is within paragraph (a), (b) or (c) of the subsection, on, reading B of F-BA-03` d a w
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST within THEN
        JUST (within AND (NOT `the dealing is under and in accordance with a licence granted under section 20`) AND (NOT `the person is not required to obtain a licence by section 20(3)`) AND (NOT `the person, the apparatus or the class of apparatus is exempt under section 20(4)`) AND (NOT `the person is exempted by an order under section 60(b)`))

§ `21. Application of certain provisions of Act to broadcasting apparatus licences`

-- src:1457 | 21. Sections 10, 12 and 16 apply, with the necessary modifications,
-- src:1458 | to broadcasting apparatus licences and broadcasting apparatus
-- src:1459 | licensees.
@ref s 21 (src:1457-1459)
-- Sections 10, 12 and 16 apply, with the necessary modifications, to broadcasting apparatus licences and licensees.
GIVEN `the section number` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 21 the section applies, with the necessary modifications, to broadcasting apparatus licences and broadcasting apparatus licensees` MEANS
    `the section number` EQUALS 10 OR `the section number` EQUALS 12 OR `the section number` EQUALS 16
